<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content={@refresh_seconds} />
    <title>Waking up…</title>
    <%!-- Inline styles, deliberately: this page serves from inside
    instance-host dispatch (EdgeHost), where a stylesheet link would
    route back into the wake flow instead of a static file. Six rules,
    brand tokens inlined — nothing external, nothing to fetch. --%>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
      body {
        margin: 0; min-height: 100dvh; display: flex; align-items: center;
        justify-content: center; padding: 1.5rem;
        background: #fafaf9; color: #1c1917;
        font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      }
      main { max-width: 24rem; width: 100%; text-align: center; }
      .ring {
        width: 3rem; height: 3rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem; border-radius: 9999px;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        background: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.12);
      }
      .ring svg { width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem; color: #d97706; animation: spin 1s linear infinite; }
      h1 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.025em; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
      p { font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #78716c; margin: 0; }
      @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ring svg { animation: none; } }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body { background: #0c0a09; color: #fafaf9; }
        p { color: #a8a29e; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main data-testid="waking-page">
      <div class="ring">
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 9 9" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h1>Waking {@name} up…</h1>
      <p>
        It sleeps when nobody visits — this usually takes a few seconds. This page refreshes
        itself.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
